<title>BULGARIA: ONE REPO DEAL ON BULGARIA'S SOFIA STOCK EXCHANGE.</title>
<headline>ONE REPO DEAL ON BULGARIA'S SOFIA STOCK EXCHANGE.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Only one seven-day repo deal in treasury paper worth of 1,464 million levs was struck on the Sofia Stock Exchange, yielding 1.90 percent until repurchase as no shares traded, brokers said.</p>
<p>No corporate stocks traded on the Bulgarian Stock Exchange for a fifth day in a row and the RABSI (Reuter All Bulgaria Stock Index) was unchanged from Tuesday at 41.14 points.</p>
<p>-- Rumen Sokolov, Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
